test space as directly as a pawn move.\n\nReason:  \nPlaying **P: e7-e5** maximizes central control, accelerates development potential, and challenges White’s ambitions in the center. It’s a principled, high-probability winning-opening move.\n\nAnswer: P: e7-e5"}
