5 if needed. It's a flexible and aggressive choice that improves piece activity without structural weaknesses.\n\nReason:  \nN: c4-e5 maximizes piece activity, increases central control, and maintains flexibility in pawn structure while posing immediate strategic threats.\n\nAnswer: N: c4-e5"}
